{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"work\": \"Frédéric Chopin, Ballade No. 4 in F minor, Op. 52\",\n  \"short_name\": \"肖邦第四叙事曲\",\n  \"total_measures\": 239,\n  \"numbering_note\": \"统一采用单乐章全曲连续编号1–239。各文献原有的小节编号、半小节标记和层级均予以保留，不进行跨来源边界换算。操作基线采用Rothstein的外层主题—变奏结构：引子1–7、主题8–22、三个变奏23–57/58–151/152–202、属音持续203–210、尾声211至终曲。Rothstein明确将尾声起点定位于211，但终点写作to the end；239采用题目提供的通行总小节数。Rothstein没有将分析绑定到一个明确指定的单一谱版，并特别讨论了第8小节额外半小节造成的节拍感知问题。其他来源的版本情况分别记录在limitations中。\",\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S1\",\n      \"author_or_institution\": \"William Rothstein\",\n      \"title\": \"Ambiguity in the Themes of Chopin's First, Second, and Fourth Ballades\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.esm.rochester.edu/integral/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/INTEGRAL_8_rothstein.pdf\",\n      \"locator\": \"Integral, Vol. 8 (1994), Fourth Ballade部分，约pp. 24–38；主题与变奏结构、第二主题、属音持续及尾声的讨论，特别是notes 29、33及有关第8小节的说明。【turn786673view0】【turn164079view0】\",\n      \"accessed_original\": true,\n      \"levels\": [\n        {\n          \"level\": \"外层主题—变奏结构（作者的主题与变奏曲式层级）\",\n          \"segments\": [\n            {\n              \"start\": 1,\n              \"end\": 7,\n              \"label\": \"Introduction\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 8,\n              \"end\": 22,\n              \"label\": \"Theme\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 23,\n              \"end\": 57,\n              \"label\": \"Variation 1\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 58,\n              \"end\": 151,\n              \"label\": \"Variation 2\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 152,\n              \"end\": 202,\n              \"label\": \"Variation 3\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 203,\n              \"end\"