2，尽管其中包含第二主题、发展性事件及主题回归。不能用其他作者的细分替换这一原有层级。\",\n        \"未指定唯一使用的谱版；保留作者原有小节编号。\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S2\",\n      \"author_or_institution\": \"Jim Samson\",\n      \"title\": \"Chopin: The Four Ballades\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/chopin-the-four-ballades/\",\n      \"locator\": \"Cambridge University Press, 1992，第四叙事曲曲式讨论，约pp. 62–68，尤其Figure 12和Figure 13（p.67）。原书内容已见，链接为出版社书目信息。【turn170692view3】【turn438936search0】\",\n      \"accessed_original\": true,\n      \"levels\": [\n        {\n          \"level\": \"Figure 13：第四叙事曲的完整形式概要\",\n          \"segments\": [\n            {\n              \"start\": 1,\n              \"end\": 7,\n              \"label\": \"Introduction\",\n              \"uncertain\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 7,\n              \"end\": 22,\n              \"label\": \"Theme I\",\n              \"uncertain\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 23,\n              \"end\": 36,\n              \"label\": \"Variation I\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 37,\n              \"end\": 57,\n              \"label\": \"Episode derived from Theme I\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 58,\n              \"end\": 71,\n              \"label\": \"Variation II\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 72,\n              \"end\": 80,\n              \"label\": \"Transition\",\n              \"uncertain\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 80,\n              \"end\": 99,\n              \"label\": \"Theme II\",\n              \"uncertain\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 99,\n              \"end\": 128,\n              \"label\": \"Development\",\n              \"uncertain\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"