             \"uncertain\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"limitations\": [\n        \"作者强调作品的形式边界并非由所有形式原则共同确定的清晰切点。\",\n        \"第四次rotation的高潮被描述为mm.195–211，而尾声又被定位为m.211开始，造成m.211的共享边界。\",\n        \"第三次rotation包含第二主题、发展部及再现部的开始；rotation与奏鸣曲式大部不是同一个层级。\",\n        \"mm.192–194没有在上述局部事件描述中获得独立段落标签。\",\n        \"未明确指定单一谱版。\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S4\",\n      \"author_or_institution\": \"Michael L. Klein\",\n      \"title\": \"Chopin's Fourth Ballade as Musical Narrative\",\n      \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1525/mts.2004.26.1.23\",\n      \"locator\": \"Music Theory Spectrum, Vol. 26, No. 1 (2004), pp. 23–55；Example 1，p.31。原文表格已见。【turn813972view0】【turn506678search5】\",\n      \"accessed_original\": true,\n      \"levels\": [\n        {\n          \"level\": \"Example 1：正式段落划分（Formal outline）\",\n          \"segments\": [\n            {\n              \"start\": 1,\n              \"end\": 7,\n              \"label\": \"Intro. Motto\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 8,\n              \"end\": 22,\n              \"label\": \"Theme 1\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 23,\n              \"end\": 37,\n              \"label\": \"Var. 1 (Th. 1)\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 38,\n              \"end\": 57,\n              \"label\": \"Interruption\",\n              \"uncertain\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 58,\n              \"end\": 71,\n              \"label\": \"Var. 2 (Th. 1)\",\n              \"uncertain\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 71,\n              \"end\": 80,\n              \"label\": \"Gang\",\n              \"uncertain\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"start\": 80,\n              \"end\": 99,\n              \"label\": \"Theme 2\